Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Emit report.md with Markdown tables for readable Slack
 posts

screen.py and execute.py now also write work/report.md using Markdown
pipe tables, which the Slack connector renders as native tables (the
old ``` code block wrapped unreadably on phones). PROMPTS.md posting
steps now paste report.md verbatim. Add .gitignore for work/ run data.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WQziQzKs2dSdVegL9kX24b
---
